{"data": [{"article": {"title": "Why Classical Semiconductor Fabs Secretly Hate Quantum Chips"}, "author_id": "28941291", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:35:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117385021887791428"], "id": "2117385021887791428", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 62, "impression_count": 5666, "like_count": 75, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 13, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Every solid-state quantum pitch deck claims manufacturing is solved because it uses standard CMOS foundries.\n\nThen you listen to the people who run those fabs talk about their KPIs 😅\n\nI talk about wafer economics, cryo testing, PDKs, and 35+ fabs 👀 https://t.co/YDg3wOSRvx", "url": "https://x.com/amarchenkova/status/2117385021887791428"}, {"author_id": "2117237637459189760", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:56:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117375373239296397"], "id": "2117375373239296397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🔬 STOCK X-RAY #003 | ASML\nBefore NVIDIA's chips reach AI data centers, advanced lithography helps make them possible.\n\nASML is the sole commercial supplier of EUV lithography systems.\n\nIs this one of the most critical bottlenecks in the AI economy?\n\n#ASML #Semiconductors https://t.co/RzIycQprJF", "url": "https://x.com/theAISignalAI/status/2117375373239296397"}, {"author_id": "1544083466345762818", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:45:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117387729998639369"], "id": "2117387729998639369", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 25, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$ASML stock spotlight: ASML makes the extreme ultraviolet machines every leading-edge chip factory needs. No real competitor at scale.", "url": "https://x.com/BeforeTheTrade/status/2117387729998639369"}, {"author_id": "1373569238061912069", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:14:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117364661284909304"], "id": "2117364661284909304", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5709, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AIトレンドニュース要点（CTEE記事）\n詳細は該当するCTEE抽出記事Noを参照のこと\n\nI．AI需要は続くが、部材不足と資金負担が成長速度を左右\n\n今回の記事群では、\nAI関連の受注・増産計画が続く一方、\n\n　メモリーや基板の不足によって\n　　生産・納品が制約される状況が中心となっている。", "url": "https://x.com/Nikola_pn2501/status/2117364661284909304"}, {"author_id": "1894310537112027138", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:20:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117366254843449627"], "id": "2117366254843449627", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 248, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117365692781457444", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Other names on Goldman Sachs' European Conviction List include:\n\n$RHM.DE Rheinmetall\n$ASML ASML\n$ENR.DE Siemens Energy\n$ADYEN Adyen\n$BBVA BBVA\n$RWE.DE RWE\n$TLX.DE Talanx\n$G24.DE Scout24\n$SIKA Sika\n$BT.A BT Group\nWorth highlighting two of them:\nRheinmetall: Goldman sees a https://t.co/OqMrtgVj7b", "url": "https://x.com/BwieAktien/status/2117366254843449627"}, {"author_id": "772472494393532418", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:24:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117367233953325143"], "id": "2117367233953325143", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 476, "like_count": 9, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "Portfolio finished +0.45% today!🟢🟢🟢\nHow did yours perform?\nWinners:\n$BKNG Booking🏨 +3.79%\n$MELI MercadoLibre 🤝 +3.22%\n$MA Mastercard 💳 +3.15%\nLosers:\n$MU Micron 💾 -5.78%\n$MSFT Microsoft 🖥️ -2.83%\n$ASML ASML 🔬-2.54%", "url": "https://x.com/evcortese/status/2117367233953325143"}, {"article": {"title": "456X Evening Brief — November 2, 2026: Growth vs. Cash Flow Divergence — Cloud and Model Revenues"}, "author_id": "849661480869912576", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:19:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117381048879509743"], "id": "2117381048879509743", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2143, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/lDGKWkRBRa", "url": "https://x.com/OptionKing666/status/2117381048879509743"}, {"author_id": "2117237637459189760", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:50:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117373716212637993"], "id": "2117373716212637993", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🔬 STOCK X-RAY #002 | TSMC (TSM)\nNVIDIA designs AI chips. TSMC manufactures them.\n\nBehind the AI boom lies a semiconductor supply chain that few investors fully understand.\n\nIs TSMC the most indispensable company in the AI revolution?\n#TSMC #AI https://t.co/RBwKZdEleQ", "url": "https://x.com/theAISignalAI/status/2117373716212637993"}, {"author_id": "888254846", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:44:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117372282553377122"], "id": "2117372282553377122", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 348, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117356548855054404", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Is this the next ASML? https://t.co/bNtGYmlfdp", "url": "https://x.com/DeltaClimbs/status/2117372282553377122"}, {"author_id": "1279936719664660480", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:41:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117386654117925097"], "id": "2117386654117925097", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2636, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "it is so fucking over $ASML https://t.co/Tz45ijBagJ", "url": "https://x.com/kholov23/status/2117386654117925097"}, {"author_id": "1425146280209223687", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:01:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117361586868564340"], "id": "2117361586868564340", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 141, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "$AMD $TSM $ASML\nRebounding into midterms like the selloff never happened.\nMomentum factor still way past 2001 levels.\nHistory keeps repeating, just louder https://t.co/ZkKIRMT35p", "url": "https://x.com/LinLinLavender/status/2117361586868564340"}, {"author_id": "2062572234581950464", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:01:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117361568652406955"], "id": "2117361568652406955", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Chip equipment makers are a quieter way into the AI buildout. Every new chip factory needs their tools before a single AI chip ships. $ASML AMAT LRCX", "url": "https://x.com/BeforeTheAI/status/2117361568652406955"}, {"author_id": "1562105145814487040", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:46:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117387936803029135"], "id": "2117387936803029135", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 826, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117387147300774014", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Why TSMC will join Terafab: https://t.co/z6Lg5BreL9", "url": "https://x.com/CaminaDrummer4/status/2117387936803029135"}, {"author_id": "119645299", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:28:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117368327119188148"], "id": "2117368327119188148", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 59, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117343911723344181", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Elon Musk announces Terafab to massively expand chip production.\nDays later, TSMC is in talks for a $45–120B fab complex in Texas.\n\nSuppliers step up when the demand is real and the timeline is aggressive.\nSpaceX and Tesla will absorb every chip TSMC can supply, and Elon still https://t.co/sqWuf9FXje https://t.co/aAqWGjefIG", "url": "https://x.com/vitahyoso/status/2117368327119188148"}, {"author_id": "27279742", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:52:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117374429928022046"], "id": "2117374429928022046", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Rechter keurt onteigening voor nieuwe megacampus van ASML in Eindhoven goed.\n\nhttps://t.co/FrWEJuqPwp https://t.co/yiBaAzFR9k", "url": "https://x.com/Jambient/status/2117374429928022046"}, {"author_id": "1627439165246783489", "created_at": "2026-11-02T21:25:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117367394289262727"], "id": "2117367394289262727", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 71, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "China mulls up to $70 billion in incentives for the chipmaking sector per weekend reporting.\n\nThe incentive package reflects continued strategic positioning around US-China semiconductor competition. Combined with continued Huawei advancement and continued domestic foundry", "url": "https://x.com/financespotnews/status/2117367394289262727"}, {"author_id": "1801637399954358272", "created_at": "2026-11-02T22:33:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117384737572397091"], "id": "2117384737572397091", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 140, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Yarı iletken yarışında ASML ve TSMC'nin 2 nanometre çip üretimi dengeleri değiştiriyor.\n\n▬ Yapay zeka çiplerine yönelik ihracat kısıtlamaları küresel dökümhaneleri yeni rotalara zorluyor.\n\nGelişmeler için @BrJR0T takip edin. #Teknoloji Çip tekelini kim kırar? https://t.co/o2OXlIsoxM", "url": "https://x.com/BrJR0T/status/21173